# Task: Configure log rotation for an application

The application `{{app_name}}` writes its log to `{{log_path}}`.

Create the logrotate configuration file `/etc/logrotate.d/{{app_name}}` so that this log file is:

- rotated weekly;
- kept for {{rotate_count}} rotations;
- compressed after rotation;
- recreated after each rotation with mode `{{create_mode}}`, owned by user `{{create_user}}` and group `{{create_group}}`.

The configuration must be accepted by logrotate without errors.
